      </header><div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-9 contents">
    <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Gets information about a deployment</h1>
    <small class="dont-index">Source: <a href="https://github.com/paws-r/paws/blob/HEAD/R/codedeploy_operations.R" class="external-link"><code>R/codedeploy_operations.R</code></a></small>
    <div class="hidden name"><code>codedeploy_get_deployment.Rd</code></div>
    </div>

    <div class="ref-description">
    <p>Gets information about a deployment.</p>
<p>The <code>content</code> property of the <code>appSpecContent</code> object in the returned
revision is always null. Use
<code><a href="codedeploy_get_application_revision.html">get_application_revision</a></code> and
the <code>sha256</code> property of the returned <code>appSpecContent</code> object to get the
content of the deployment’s AppSpec file.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="ref-usage">
    <div class="sourceCode"><pre class="sourceCode r"><code><span><span class="fu">codedeploy_get_deployment</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="va">deploymentId</span><span class="op">)</span></span></code></pre></div>
    </div>

    <div id="arguments">
    <h2>Arguments</h2>
    <dl><dt>deploymentId</dt>
<dd><p>[required] The unique ID of a deployment associated with the IAM user or AWS
account.</p></dd>

</dl></div>
    <div id="value">
    <h2>Value</h2>
    

<p>A list with the following syntax:</p>


